# Leave this unset for local development and same-origin production builds.
# The Vite dev server proxies /api to http://localhost:3000 and forwards cookies
# on the same origin, so the HTTP-only auth cookie works locally.
# Production Docker/Render builds also default to /api (same origin).
# Only set this if the API is on a different origin. That API must allow this
# app's origin with credentials. Do not put secrets in frontend environment variables.
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3000/api
